Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.60,0:00:02.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,(Tick, tock, click, clack)
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.72,0:00:05.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head on the stand…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.70,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.86,0:00:22.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I spawn in with the default hair,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.98,0:00:25.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head, simple smile, no care.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Start with the stand, one lemon at a time,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Click the button, watch the cash climb.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.90,0:00:34.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Upgrade the juicer, double the pay,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.82,0:00:38.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Automate the stand so I can walk away.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.02,0:00:41.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Money on the floor, walk over and grab,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.14,0:00:44.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then buy the next thing, keep on the tab.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons, sell the lemons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head selling lemons all day.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons, sell the lemons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.78,0:00:57.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Click, upgrade, sell, don't stop the play.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.02,0:00:58.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons (sell the lemons),
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.44,0:01:01.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons (sell the lemons),
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head, sell the lemons,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.36,0:01:07.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Never gonna stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.52,0:01:10.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons, never gonna stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.10,0:01:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Never gonna stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.32,0:01:16.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lemon Dash, Lemon Depot, the numbers get big,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.24,0:01:20.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jetpack on, fly up high, do a little jig.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rebirth when the buttons cost too much,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.58,0:01:26.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Joe the alien shows up, give the button a touch.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Multipliers stack, the cash comes in waves,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.90,0:01:32.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Void portal opens, evolution saves.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.06,0:01:35.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,From stand to space, the empire keeps growing,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.14,0:01:38.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head on the screen, the lemons still flowing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons, sell the lemons,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.88,0:01:44.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head selling lemons all day.
