Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.00,0:02:04.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Click, sell, upgrade, sell,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.08,0:02:06.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Click, sell, upgrade, sell.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.84,0:02:09.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Automate the line, watch the cash fly,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.90,0:02:13.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head dancing while the numbers go high.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.00,0:02:16.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.05,0:02:19.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.10,0:02:22.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.15,0:02:25.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.90,0:02:28.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,World 2 comes, oxygen next,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.94,0:02:32.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same loop, bigger checks, never perplexed.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.14,0:02:35.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Offline cash keeps ticking while I sleep,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.14,0:02:38.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wake up richer, the empire is deep.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shake the trees, grab the bags, do the deals,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bacon head still selling, that's how it feels.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.80,0:02:46.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,From one little stand to the top of the sky,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.66,0:02:50.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons, keep the machine running high.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.38,0:02:56.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sell the lemons, sell the lemons,
